{"id":"88f82b7d634f98ce","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/638_度量时序逻辑_MTL.md","title":"638 度量时序逻辑 MTL","display":"638_度量时序逻辑_MTL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。统一时间域为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T_{638}=\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb T_{638}=\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>度量区间集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Int}_{638}=\\{(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r):l,r\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\},\\ l\\le r,\\ \\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Int}_{638}=\\{(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r):l,r\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\},\\ l\\le r,\\ \\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r\\in\\{0,1\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon_l=1\">\\(\\epsilon_l=1\\)</span> 表示左端闭，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon_r=1\">\\(\\epsilon_r=1\\)</span> 表示右端闭。定义类型化点集函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}:\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb T_{638}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}:\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb T_{638}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r)\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\">\\(I=(l,r,\\epsilon_l,\\epsilon_r)\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\)</span>，令：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\n=\n\\{t\\in\\mathbb T_{638}:\n((\\epsilon_l=1\\wedge l\\le t)\\vee(\\epsilon_l=0\\wedge l&lt;t))\n\\wedge\n((r=\\infty)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=1\\wedge t\\le r)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=0\\wedge t&lt;r))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\n=\n\\{t\\in\\mathbb T_{638}:\n((\\epsilon_l=1\\wedge l\\le t)\\vee(\\epsilon_l=0\\wedge l&lt;t))\n\\wedge\n((r=\\infty)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=1\\wedge t\\le r)\\vee(\\epsilon_r=0\\wedge t&lt;r))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\in_{638}I\\Longleftrightarrow t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\in_{638}I\\Longleftrightarrow t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义区间包含谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{638}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\times\\mathsf{Int}_{638},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{638}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\times\\mathsf{Int}_{638},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{638}J\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{638}J\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>下文的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\">\\(I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{638}J\">\\(I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{638}J\\)</span> 的显示缩写。</p>\n<p>定义部分区间并关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{UnionInt}_{638}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Int}_{638}^{\\,3},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{UnionInt}_{638}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Int}_{638}^{\\,3},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{UnionInt}_{638}(I,J,K)\">\\(\\mathsf{UnionInt}_{638}(I,J,K)\\)</span>（显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=I\\cup J\">\\(K=I\\cup J\\)</span>）当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J,K\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\">\\(I,J,K\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\)</span> 且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(K)=\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\cup\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(K)=\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\cup\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{until}_I,\\operatorname{since}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{until}_I,\\operatorname{since}_I\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,U_I\\,B\">\\(A\\,U_I\\,B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,S_I\\,B\">\\(A\\,S_I\\,B\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,U_I\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(A\\,U_I\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,S_I\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(A\\,S_I\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A\\,U_I\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A\\,U_I\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A\\,S_I\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A\\,S_I\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{638}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{638}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{638}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{638}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{638}\\)</span> 为所有有限支撑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span> 的集合，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{638}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{638}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是有限集。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{638}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{638}\\)</span> 唯一扩张为类型化函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{638}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{638}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A\\,U_I\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A)\\,U_I\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(B),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A\\,S_I\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A)\\,S_I\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A\\,U_I\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A)\\,U_I\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(B),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A\\,S_I\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(A)\\,S_I\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{638}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,638}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,638}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{638}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{638}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{638}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{638}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{638}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{638}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>度量公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{IntMon}^{638}=\\{(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\to(A\\,U_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I,J\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{IntMon}^{638}=\\{(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\to(A\\,U_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I,J\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PastIntMon}^{638}=\\{(A\\,S_I\\,B)\\to(A\\,S_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I,J\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PastIntMon}^{638}=\\{(A\\,S_I\\,B)\\to(A\\,S_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I,J\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{638}=\\{B\\to(A\\,U_I\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},0\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{638}=\\{B\\to(A\\,U_I\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},0\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PastZero}^{638}=\\{B\\to(A\\,S_I\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},0\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PastZero}^{638}=\\{B\\to(A\\,S_I\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},0\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Split}^{638}=\\{(A\\,U_K\\,B)\\leftrightarrow((A\\,U_I\\,B)\\lor(A\\,U_J\\,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I,J,K\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638},\\mathsf{UnionInt}_{638}(I,J,K)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Split}^{638}=\\{(A\\,U_K\\,B)\\leftrightarrow((A\\,U_I\\,B)\\lor(A\\,U_J\\,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I,J,K\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638},\\mathsf{UnionInt}_{638}(I,J,K)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{638}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{638}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{638}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{638}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{IntMon}^{638}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PastIntMon}^{638}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{638}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PastZero}^{638}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Split}^{638}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{638}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{638}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{638}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{638}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{IntMon}^{638}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PastIntMon}^{638}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{638}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PastZero}^{638}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Split}^{638}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{638}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{638}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{IntIncl}^{638}=\\{((A\\,U_I\\,B),A\\,U_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{IntIncl}^{638}=\\{((A\\,U_I\\,B),A\\,U_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{PastIntIncl}^{638}=\\{((A\\,S_I\\,B),A\\,S_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{PastIntIncl}^{638}=\\{((A\\,S_I\\,B),A\\,S_J\\,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqI}^{638}=\\{((A\\leftrightarrow C,\\ B\\leftrightarrow D),(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,U_I\\,D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqI}^{638}=\\{((A\\leftrightarrow C,\\ B\\leftrightarrow D),(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,U_I\\,D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{PastEqI}^{638}=\\{((A\\leftrightarrow C,\\ B\\leftrightarrow D),(A\\,S_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,S_I\\,D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{PastEqI}^{638}=\\{((A\\leftrightarrow C,\\ B\\leftrightarrow D),(A\\,S_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,S_I\\,D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{638}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{638}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{638}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{IntIncl}^{638}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{PastIntIncl}^{638}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqI}^{638}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{PastEqI}^{638}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{638}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{638}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{IntIncl}^{638}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{PastIntIncl}^{638}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqI}^{638}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{PastEqI}^{638}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Line}_{638}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{638})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Line}_{638}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{638})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{638}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{638})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Line}_{638}^{\\,m}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{638}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{638})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Line}_{638}^{\\,m}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span>。证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{638}^{\\,m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{638}^{\\,m}\\)</span>。每个合法行索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列 7 项中的一项（各项之间为析取，各项内部条件为合取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{638}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{638}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,I,J\">\\(A,B,I,J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\,U_I\\,B\">\\(A_j=A\\,U_I\\,B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\\,U_J\\,B\">\\(A_i=A\\,U_J\\,B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\">\\(I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,D,I\">\\(A,B,C,D,I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow C\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=B\\leftrightarrow D\">\\(A_k=B\\leftrightarrow D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,U_I\\,D)\">\\(A_i=(A\\,U_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,U_I\\,D)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_k=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_k=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,I,J\">\\(A,B,I,J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\,S_I\\,B\">\\(A_j=A\\,S_I\\,B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\\,S_J\\,B\">\\(A_i=A\\,S_J\\,B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\">\\(I\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}J\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,D,I\">\\(A,B,C,D,I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow C\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=B\\leftrightarrow D\">\\(A_k=B\\leftrightarrow D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\,S_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,S_I\\,D)\">\\(A_i=(A\\,S_I\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(C\\,S_I\\,D)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_k=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_k=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{638}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{638}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 恰为上述每行满足至少一项许可的正长有型序列集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{638}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{638}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_j,A_j))_{j&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{638}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_j,A_j))_{j&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{638}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，使第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 行的结论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{638}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{638}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{638}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{638}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>MTL 的目标差异是 every until 构造子携带有理端点区间参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>，并且区间包含与区间并在公理和规则侧条件中本地定义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-实时迹与区间点集\">10. 实时迹与区间点集</h1>\n<p>定义实时迹集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TTrace}_{638}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb T_{638}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TTrace}_{638}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb T_{638}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-满足关系\">11. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{638}\\subseteq\\mathsf{TTrace}_{638}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{638}\\subseteq\\mathsf{TTrace}_{638}\\times\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为满足下列递归子句的最小关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{638}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{638}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{638}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{638}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{638}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\not\\Vdash_{638}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}A\\,U_I\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in\\mathbb T_{638}\\,\n\\bigl(t\\le u\\wedge u-t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\wedge\n\\nu,u\\Vdash_{638}B\\wedge\n\\forall v\\in\\mathbb T_{638}(t\\le v&lt;u\\to\\nu,v\\Vdash_{638}A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}A\\,U_I\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in\\mathbb T_{638}\\,\n\\bigl(t\\le u\\wedge u-t\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\wedge\n\\nu,u\\Vdash_{638}B\\wedge\n\\forall v\\in\\mathbb T_{638}(t\\le v&lt;u\\to\\nu,v\\Vdash_{638}A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}A\\,S_I\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in\\mathbb T_{638}\\,\n\\bigl(u\\le t\\wedge t-u\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\wedge\n\\nu,u\\Vdash_{638}B\\wedge\n\\forall v\\in\\mathbb T_{638}(u&lt;v\\le t\\to\\nu,v\\Vdash_{638}A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}A\\,S_I\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in\\mathbb T_{638}\\,\n\\bigl(u\\le t\\wedge t-u\\in\\operatorname{Pt}_{638}(I)\\wedge\n\\nu,u\\Vdash_{638}B\\wedge\n\\forall v\\in\\mathbb T_{638}(u&lt;v\\le t\\to\\nu,v\\Vdash_{638}A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-语义后果\">12. 语义后果</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{638}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{638}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{TTrace}_{638}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{TTrace}_{638}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,t\\Vdash_{638}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{638}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}:\\varnothing\\models_{638}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{638}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{638}:\\varnothing\\models_{638}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{MTL}_{638}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathbb T_{638},\\mathsf{Int}_{638},\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},\\operatorname{FV}_{638},\\operatorname{BV}_{638},\\mathsf{Subst}_{638},\\widehat\\sigma_{638},\\equiv_{\\alpha,638},\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{638},\\mathsf{UnionInt}_{638},\\mathsf{Ax}_{638},\\mathsf{Rule}_{638},\\mathsf{Line}_{638},\\mathsf{Proof}_{638},\\vdash_{638},\\mathsf{Thm}_{638}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{MTL}_{638}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathbb T_{638},\\mathsf{Int}_{638},\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},\\operatorname{FV}_{638},\\operatorname{BV}_{638},\\mathsf{Subst}_{638},\\widehat\\sigma_{638},\\equiv_{\\alpha,638},\\subseteq_{\\mathsf I}^{638},\\mathsf{UnionInt}_{638},\\mathsf{Ax}_{638},\\mathsf{Rule}_{638},\\mathsf{Line}_{638},\\mathsf{Proof}_{638},\\vdash_{638},\\mathsf{Thm}_{638}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>扩展后的完整对象为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{MTL}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{638}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathbb T_{638},\\mathsf{Int}_{638},\\operatorname{Pt}_{638},\\in_{638},\\mathsf{Frm}_{638},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{638},\\operatorname{BV}_{638},\\mathsf{Su